WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.967
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:03.002
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.204
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:06.072
[ Cheering and applause ]
This is very exciting --

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:08.207
last night was our first night
with an audience.

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:10.509
This is the exact same group
of people.

00:00:10.509 --> 00:00:11.678
They refused to leave.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:16.115
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:17.416
Let's get to the news,
everybody.

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:20.253
Dr. Anthony Fauci said,
in an interview on Sunday,

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.788
that it's safe for Americans

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.723
to go trick-or-treating
this year on Halloween.

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:27.593
Though, remember, you may get
something worse than COVID.

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:29.662
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.864
According to a new poll,

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:34.500
Americans are losing trust
in President Biden's ability

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.469
to handle
the coronavirus pandemic.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:37.537
Really?

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.905
Who's handling it well?

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:40.540
[ Laughter ]
We're all losing it.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.142
"The Brady Bunch"
came on the other day

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:44.243
and I thought it was
a Zoom meeting.

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:46.345
[ Laughter and applause ]
Can't wait to hear

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:48.214
Cindy's thoughts on marketing.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:51.217
I don't trust anyone
who's handling it well.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.087
When I'm at ShopRite and there's
an old guy with no mask on

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:56.055
just smiling
and touching all the cans,

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:57.490
whistling a happy tune,
I don't think,

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.958
"Oh, I wish he was in charge."

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:00.259
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:02.128
The State Department
inspector general

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:03.696
is reportedly investigating

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:06.499
several instances
of misappropriated gifts

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.834
from foreign governments
during the Trump administration,

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:13.272
including a missing $5,800
bottle of Japanese whiskey

00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:14.707
and I found it.

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.776
[ Laughter and applause ]
Right there.

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:19.579
It was --

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:22.415
It was a bottle of whiskey
who wished

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.083
it was a real man.

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:25.317
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.317 --> 00:01:26.819
But he wished it
on a monkey paw.

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:28.988
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.823
Arizona Senator Kyrsten Sinema

00:01:30.823 --> 00:01:32.658
yesterday attended
the Boston Marathon,

00:01:32.658 --> 00:01:34.927
but did not run the race,
due to a foot injury,

00:01:34.927 --> 00:01:38.363
but did manage to get in the way
of the people handing stuff out.

00:01:38.363 --> 00:01:39.966
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:41.367
The Taliban --

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:42.868
The Taliban!

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:45.138
[ Cheer and laughter ]

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:47.173
[ As Trump ] The Taliban,
we love the Taliban.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:49.943
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:52.779
The Taliban has reportedly
instructed its religious police

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:55.781
to be more moderate,
which means even the Taliban

00:01:55.781 --> 00:01:57.950
passed police reform
before we did.

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:00.553
[ Laughter, oohs,
and applause ]

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:03.456
[ Cheering ]
Pope Francis --

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:06.225
Pope Francis over the weekend
launched a two-year initiative

00:02:06.225 --> 00:02:08.961
to consult every Catholic parish
around the world

00:02:08.961 --> 00:02:10.563
about the future of the Church.

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:13.132
And this is cool --
because of how often

00:02:13.132 --> 00:02:14.700
they get moved around,

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:16.969
a lot of priests are going
to meet him twice.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:20.739
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:02:20.739 --> 00:02:22.041
That's cool, alright.

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.443
Alright.
I'd like to point out --

00:02:24.443 --> 00:02:25.778
super fair hit.

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.546
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:27.546 --> 00:02:30.482
Super fair hit.

00:02:30.482 --> 00:02:32.785
LEGO announced yesterday
that it will remove

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:34.820
all gender stereotypes
from its toys,

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:37.422
though there will still be
some gender stereotypes

00:02:37.422 --> 00:02:38.691
when you step on one.

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:39.858
"Son of a bitch!"

00:02:39.858 --> 00:02:41.527
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:43.796
DC Comics announced yesterday

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:47.066
that the new Superman character
will come out as bisexual.

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:49.769
[ Cheering and applause ]
Come on, it's 2021.

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:53.005
The crazy part is that there are
still Superman comics.

00:02:53.005 --> 00:02:55.875
You see, kids,
he's a reporter at a newspaper.

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:57.576
"He's a what at a what?"

00:02:57.576 --> 00:03:00.647
[ Laughter and applause ]
He changes in a telephone booth.

00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:01.914
"What are you talking about?

00:03:01.914 --> 00:03:04.583
[ Laughter and applause ]
What are these things?"

00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:07.486
McDonald's is offering
free breakfast meals this week

00:03:07.486 --> 00:03:09.088
to teachers and support staff,

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:12.024
giving teachers a chance
to do what they love most --

00:03:12.024 --> 00:03:13.559
eat in their car.

00:03:13.559 --> 00:03:14.894
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:18.897
A man in England recently
visited 51 bars in 24 hours,

00:03:18.897 --> 00:03:21.133
in an attempt to set
a Guinness World Record.

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:23.536
The record was for most COVID.

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:25.371
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:27.339
And, finally,
firefighters in Florida

00:03:27.339 --> 00:03:29.175
recently rescued a kitten

00:03:29.175 --> 00:03:31.911
that was stuck in the inner
workings of a Tesla.

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:33.679
Said the Tesla's owner,

00:03:33.679 --> 00:03:35.547
"I have a Tesla."

00:03:35.547 --> 00:03:37.917
[ Laughter and applause ]

